 "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3c662d99315a0a5412c3ceaac5b6d01603249bf85ee9dda17dd917faddfb3423", "stage": "STRUCTURE_OK", "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "fully faithful", "target_term": "完全忠实"}, {"source_term": "natural", "target_term": "自然的"}, {"source_term": "composite", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "bijection", "target_term": "双射"}, {"source_term": "faithful", "target_term": "忠实的"}, {"source_term": "full faithfulness", "target_term": "完全忠实性"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射的"}, {"source_term": "adjunction", "target_term": "伴随"}, {"source_term": "bijection", "target_term": "双射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "natural", "target_term": "自然的"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "adjunction", "target_term": "伴随"}, {"source_term": "counit", "target_term": "余单位"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射的"}, {"source_term": "dual", "target_term": "对偶"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "证明(2)。假设<MATH_0001>完全忠实（fully faithful）。设我们有<MATH_0002>、<MATH_0003>，它们在<MATH_0004>中。那么自然的（natural）复合（composite）映射（map）\n<MATH_0005>\n是双射（bijection），故<MATH_0006>至少是忠实的（faithful）。为证明完全忠实性（full faithfulness），必须证明上面的第二个映射（map）是单射的（injective）。但<MATH_0007>与<MATH_0008>之间的伴随（adjunction）说明\n<MATH_0009>\n是双射（bijection），其中第一个映射（map）是自然的（natural），第二个映射（map）来自该伴随（adjunction）的余单位（counit）<MATH_0010>。因此，这说明\n<MATH_0011>\n也是单射的（injective），这正是所要的。(1)的证明与此对偶（dual）。\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:dae39627494cf04606937a072ad3873431f76ce2606f53c44cac5f80db39bf87", "unit_id": "tag:0FWV:proof", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "假设中的函子性质；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "fully faithful", "target_term": "完全忠实"}, {"context": "由函子或伴随给出的自然映射；暂定译法。", "source_term": "natural", "target_term": "自然的"}, {"context": "两个映射的复合；暂定译法。", "source_term": "composite", "target_term": "复合"}, {"context": "态射集之间的映射；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"context": "完全忠实性及伴随给出的双射；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "bijection", "target_term": "双射"}, {"context": "先获得的忠实性；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "faithful", "target_term": "忠实的"}, {"context": "需要证明的完全忠实性；暂定译法。", "source_term": "full faithfulness", "target_term": "完全忠实性"}, {"context": "态射集映射的单射性；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射的"}, {"context": "给定的函子伴随；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "adjunction", "target_term": "伴随"}, {"context": "伴随的余单位自然变换；暂定译法。", "source_term": "counit", "target_term": "余单位"}, {"context": "第一项与第二项的证明关系；暂定译法。", "source_term": "dual", "target_term": "对偶"}]}
